{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1441872-names-of-weapons-bonus-question-at-the-end-yearh-p","id":1441872,"title":"Names of weapons?? bonus question at the end YEARH! :-P","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-29T03:57:47-07:00","id":1441872,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Names of weapons?? bonus question at the end YEARH! :-P","content":"So I have been going through some the new books to find out what are the stats for the different weapon types and noticed that not every weapon made it over from previous eds<br /> <br /> So I always like that exalted artifact weapon had wacky and cool names (why does armor not have that??????)<br /> <br /> But there are some I cant find, so I am asking the forum for help<br /> <br /> Artifact to mundane<br /> Daikalbar (from 2nd)<br /> wavecleaver (from 2nd)<br /> <br /> mundane to artifact<br /> sai (becomes a bane claw right??)<br /> knife<br /> hook sword (hook daiklave??)<br /> club/beton<br /> harpoon/javelin<br /> rapier<br /> hand needle<br /> garrotte<br /> whip (dire lash ??)<br /> Hand crossbow<br /> shuriken<br /> dart<br /> needle<br /> poleaxe/halbred<br /> <br /> There are probaly more, but these are the ones I have time to write down now.<br /> <br /> Here is one the confuses one of my fellow players a bit<br /> A lance (heavy weapon) is called a dire lance<br /> A short spear is supposely called a longfang<br /> what is a regular spear then called??<br /> <br /> Bonus question<br /> If you were to give the artifact armors names like artifacts weapons what would they be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/